    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47449" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡπᾰτ-ῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>in the liver</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσεντερία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(1).145
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἡ</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέψ</span>) the <i>vena cava ascendens</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Oss.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Apoll.
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				512a6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>liver-coloured</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλόη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					6.6.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				7.6
			</span></i>; <i>hepatitis [gemma</i>], <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.186
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <i>liver-wort</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπατώριον</span>
			, Ps. -<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.41
			</span></i>.</div>
